        "abstract": "Construction of new data assets from social media using techniques from information retrieval, machine learning, graphs, and social networks. Describes three projects based on Twitter and Foursquare data: a recommender system for recreational queries, a social knowledge graph from Twitter, and an application for archiving and Wikification of stories.",
